+device is enumerated on Windows at all -- Windows reaches the same hardware
+through ISP1's own _CRS -- so this gate reads as one left open for an OS that
+does not claim Windows 2022. Enabling the device in the override is preferred
+to booting acpi_osi="!Windows 2022", which would also un-gate SVP0, NH1X and
+NMAP and change _OSI-dependent behaviour platform-wide.
 
